Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.60,青空标,,0,0,0,,第二集：赛博泄露
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.61,青空注,,0,0,0,,AozoraSubs | 青空字幕组\N校对：汐琥\N字幕样式：NixieSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.56,0:00:04.80,青空标,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1632,1098)}复盘室 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:25.08,青空英,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, we have a mole.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:25.08,青空中,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们，我们出了个内鬼。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:25.99,青空英,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:25.99,青空中,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.99,0:00:27.52,青空英,,0,0,0,,Not this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.99,0:00:27.52,青空中,,0,0,0,,又来这套。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:32.40,青空英,,0,0,0,,Crucial, DHL eSports division logistics have been leaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:32.40,青空中,,0,0,0,,关键的是，DHL 电竞部门的物流信息被泄露了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.40,0:00:33.82,青空英,,0,0,0,,They got everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.40,0:00:33.82,青空中,,0,0,0,,他们拿到了一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:39.18,青空英,,0,0,0,,Comms, strats, most importantly, our trophy transportation plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:39.18,青空中,,0,0,0,,通讯、战术，最重要的是，我们的奖杯运输计划。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.18,0:00:43.00,青空英,,0,0,0,,I don't know how and I don't know why,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.18,0:00:43.00,青空中,,0,0,0,,我不知道是怎么泄露的，也不知道为什么，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:48.73,青空英,,0,0,0,,but somehow this job turns everything into a coach-scandal-level investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:48.73,青空中,,0,0,0,,但不知怎的，这活儿总能变成教练丑闻级别的调查。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:54.35,青空英,,0,0,0,,And I will find out who did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:54.35,青空中,,0,0,0,,而我会查出来是谁干的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.76,0:00:57.08,青空英,,0,0,0,,Good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.76,0:00:57.08,青空中,,0,0,0,,祝你好运咯。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.99,0:01:47.37,青空英,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.99,0:01:47.37,青空中,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.37,0:01:50.82,青空英,,0,0,0,,Uh, nothing, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.37,0:01:50.82,青空中,,0,0,0,,呃，没什么，没什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.25,0:01:52.65,青空英,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.25,0:01:52.65,青空中,,0,0,0,,好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.27,0:02:10.55,青空英,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.27,0:02:10.55,青空中,,0,0,0,,说说吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.35,0:02:12.22,青空英,,0,0,0,,Chad,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.35,0:02:12.22,青空中,,0,0,0,,Chad，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.75,0:02:17.04,青空英,,0,0,0,,gatekeeper of information, master of the VAC net.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.75,0:02:17.04,青空中,,0,0,0,,信息的守门人，VAC 网络的主宰。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.50,0:02:20.73,青空英,,0,0,0,,What was your role in this operation?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.50,0:02:20.73,青空中,,0,0,0,,你在这场行动里扮演什么角色？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.37,0:02:29.44,青空英,,0,0,0,,I anticipated this from the moment I heard there was a leak. I knew you'd come to me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.37,0:02:29.44,青空中,,0,0,0,,我一听说有泄露就料到了。我就知道你会先来找我。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.44,0:02:32.34,青空英,,0,0,0,,Why? Because that's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.44,0:02:32.34,青空中,,0,0,0,,为什么？因为我就是干这个的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.34,0:02:39.54,青空英,,0,0,0,,I oversee all office systems from configs to autoexecs to peripherals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.34,0:02:39.54,青空中,,0,0,0,,我掌管所有办公系统，从配置文件到 autoexec 脚本再到外设。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.54,0:02:43.60,青空英,,0,0,0,,If there was a leak, I would have known about it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.54,0:02:43.60,青空中,,0,0,0,,要是真有泄露，我本该第一个知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.26,0:02:47.86,青空英,,0,0,0,,I see things others don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.26,0:02:47.86,青空中,,0,0,0,,我能看到别人看不到的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:56.85,青空英,,0,0,0,,Sees things others don't. Very suspicious, you could say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:56.85,青空中,,0,0,0,,“能看到别人看不到的东西”，可以说相当可疑了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.85,0:03:00.88,青空英,,0,0,0,,Come on now, Alex, if I wanted to destroy you, I'd do it properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.85,0:03:00.88,青空中,,0,0,0,,得了吧，Alex，如果我想毁了你，我会做得体面些。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:07.78,青空英,,0,0,0,,Steam logins, friends lists, skins, VAC bans...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:07.78,青空中,,0,0,0,,Steam 登录、好友列表、皮肤、VAC 封禁……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.78,0:03:09.40,青空英,,0,0,0,,You'd go down for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.78,0:03:09.40,青空中,,0,0,0,,你会彻底完蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.86,0:03:11.62,青空英,,0,0,0,,Okay, but
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.86,0:03:11.62,青空中,,0,0,0,,好吧，但
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:20.90,青空英,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't do that, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:20.90,青空中,,0,0,0,,你不会那样做，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.90,0:03:24.22,青空英,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't, but I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.90,0:03:24.22,青空中,,0,0,0,,我不会，但我能。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.22,0:03:26.66,青空英,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.22,0:03:26.66,青空中,,0,0,0,,是啊，你能。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:29.45,青空英,,0,0,0,,But you wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:29.45,青空中,,0,0,0,,但你不会。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.45,0:03:30.87,青空英,,0,0,0,,But I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.45,0:03:30.87,青空中,,0,0,0,,但我能。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.87,0:03:31.75,青空英,,0,0,0,,You could.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.87,0:03:31.75,青空中,,0,0,0,,你能。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:32.32,青空英,,0,0,0,,I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:32.32,青空中,,0,0,0,,我能。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:33.84,青空英,,0,0,0,,You could.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:33.84,青空中,,0,0,0,,你能。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.84,0:03:36.22,青空英,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but why would you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.84,0:03:36.22,青空中,,0,0,0,,是啊，但你为什么要这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.22,0:03:38.76,青空英,,0,0,0,,when you could lead this investigation?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.22,0:03:38.76,青空中,,0,0,0,,你明明可以主导这次调查？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.45,0:03:43.47,青空英,,0,0,0,,Me and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.45,0:03:43.47,青空中,,0,0,0,,你和我。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.81,0:03:48.19,青空英,,0,0,0,,Batman, I'm Robin, I'm in the underpants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.81,0:03:48.19,青空中,,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠，我是罗宾，我穿着内裤。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.19,0:03:49.01,青空英,,0,0,0,,Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.19,0:03:49.01,青空中,,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.01,0:03:49.68,青空英,,0,0,0,,You're Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.01,0:03:49.68,青空中,,0,0,0,,你是蝙蝠侠。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.68,0:03:50.94,青空英,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.68,0:03:50.94,青空中,,0,0,0,,我？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.77,0:03:58.92,青空英,,0,0,0,,Knowledge is power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.77,0:03:58.92,青空中,,0,0,0,,知识就是力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.89,0:04:02.50,青空英,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, my time on the dark side of IRC
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.89,0:04:02.50,青空中,,0,0,0,,幸好我在 IRC 暗黑圈的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.50,0:04:06.34,青空英,,0,0,0,,means I know a couple of very bad people capable of many great things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.50,0:04:06.34,青空中,,0,0,0,,让我认识几个很坏、但能干大事的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.34,0:04:10.22,青空英,,0,0,0,,If we want to solve this mystery, we need to go to a master leaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.34,0:04:10.22,青空中,,0,0,0,,想解开这个谜团，我们得去找一位泄密大师。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.46,0:04:11.81,青空英,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.46,0:04:11.81,青空中,,0,0,0,,行，我能办，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.81,0:04:13.83,青空英,,0,0,0,,but it's not going to be cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.81,0:04:13.83,青空中,,0,0,0,,但可不便宜。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.83,0:04:16.23,青空英,,0,0,0,,To some, this may feel like a waste of time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.83,0:04:16.23,青空中,,0,0,0,,在有些人看来，这可能是浪费时间，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.23,0:04:21.95,青空英,,0,0,0,,but to me, we have now ruled out two crucial candidates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.23,0:04:21.95,青空中,,0,0,0,,但在我看来，我们已经排除了两个关键嫌疑人。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.26,0:04:25.48,青空英,,0,0,0,,Freya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.26,0:04:25.48,青空中,,0,0,0,,Freya。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.35,0:04:28.79,青空英,,0,0,0,,Front of house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.35,0:04:28.79,青空中,,0,0,0,,前台。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.20,0:04:32.82,青空英,,0,0,0,,The Wall Street of logistics.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.20,0:04:32.82,青空中,,0,0,0,,物流界的华尔街。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.15,0:04:35.11,青空英,,0,0,0,,Emails.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.15,0:04:35.11,青空中,,0,0,0,,邮件。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.11,0:04:36.59,青空英,,0,0,0,,Calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.11,0:04:36.59,青空中,,0,0,0,,电话。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.14,0:04:40.10,青空英,,0,0,0,,If external communications were intercepted,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.14,0:04:40.10,青空中,,0,0,0,,如果对外通讯被拦截了，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:45.11,青空英,,0,0,0,,they were intercepted here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:45.11,青空中,,0,0,0,,那就是在这儿被拦截的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:50.62,青空英,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a great theory. You should totally investigate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:50.62,青空中,,0,0,0,,听起来是个不错的理论，你该去查查。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.42,0:04:58.14,青空英,,0,0,0,,Clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.42,0:04:58.14,青空中,,0,0,0,,聪明。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.67,0:05:00.03,青空英,,0,0,0,,What is that decoy screen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.67,0:05:00.03,青空中,,0,0,0,,那是诱饵屏幕吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:02.26,青空英,,0,0,0,,40,000 viewers?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:02.26,青空中,,0,0,0,,4 万观众？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.50,0:05:07.26,青空英,,0,0,0,,I mean, mind you could blow up any time I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.50,0:05:07.26,青空中,,0,0,0,,我是说，我想什么时候引爆都行。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:12.12,青空英,,0,0,0,,- DHL eSports logistics. - Alex!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:12.12,青空中,,0,0,0,,- DHL 电竞物流 - Alex！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.12,0:05:12.70,青空英,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.12,0:05:12.70,青空中,,0,0,0,,这是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:13.74,青空英,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:13.74,青空中,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.74,0:05:15.09,青空英,,0,0,0,,Listen, buster,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.74,0:05:15.09,青空中,,0,0,0,,听着，伙计，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.09,0:05:16.48,青空英,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.09,0:05:16.48,青空中,,0,0,0,,我不知道你是谁，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:18.68,青空英,,0,0,0,,but if you don't start singing like a canary,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:18.68,青空中,,0,0,0,,但你要是不乖乖招供，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.68,0:05:20.24,青空英,,0,0,0,,things will end badly for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.68,0:05:20.24,青空中,,0,0,0,,结局会很难看。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.24,0:05:22.15,青空英,,0,0,0,,Hey, who is the name of the mole?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.24,0:05:22.15,青空中,,0,0,0,,嘿，内鬼是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.15,0:05:23.46,青空英,,0,0,0,,Give me the name of the mole.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.15,0:05:23.46,青空中,,0,0,0,,把内鬼的名字给我。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:26.26,青空英,,0,0,0,,This is Frankie Ward from head office.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:26.26,青空中,,0,0,0,,我是总部的 Frankie Ward。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:27.57,青空英,,0,0,0,,I don't appreciate your tone,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:27.57,青空中,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢你的语气，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.57,0:05:29.05,青空英,,0,0,0,,and what do you mean, mole?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.57,0:05:29.05,青空中,,0,0,0,,还有，你说“内鬼”是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.05,0:05:30.89,青空英,,0,0,0,,Has there been another breach?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.05,0:05:30.89,青空中,,0,0,0,,又出泄露事件了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:17.58,青空英,,0,0,0,,Just walk, just walk, just walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:17.58,青空中,,0,0,0,,走，走，快走。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.58,0:06:19.58,青空英,,0,0,0,,Just walk, please, just walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.58,0:06:19.58,青空中,,0,0,0,,走啊，求你了，快走。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.34,0:06:22.01,青空英,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.34,0:06:22.01,青空中,,0,0,0,,啊，这不错。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.81,0:06:26.10,青空英,,0,0,0,,So what exactly am I looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.81,0:06:26.10,青空中,,0,0,0,,所以我到底在看什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.65,0:06:27.29,青空英,,0,0,0,,Just the usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.65,0:06:27.29,青空中,,0,0,0,,老样子。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.56,0:06:30.02,青空英,,0,0,0,,Alex has left his stream on for like four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.56,0:06:30.02,青空中,,0,0,0,,Alex 的直播大概开了四天没关。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:31.09,青空英,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:31.09,青空中,,0,0,0,,太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.42,0:06:33.72,青空英,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we might have to be up your dad any day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.42,0:06:33.72,青空中,,0,0,0,,是啊，搞不好我们哪天就得给你爸送终了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.76,0:06:39.54,青空英,,0,0,0,,Did you say four whole days?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.76,0:06:39.54,青空中,,0,0,0,,你说整整四天？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.54,0:06:41.00,青空英,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.54,0:06:41.00,青空中,,0,0,0,,是啊，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.38,0:06:44.89,青空英,,0,0,0,,I think we may have found our mole.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.38,0:06:44.89,青空中,,0,0,0,,我想我们可能找到内鬼了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.11,0:06:47.90,青空英,,0,0,0,,Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.11,0:06:47.90,青空中,,0,0,0,,天！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.91,0:06:50.91,青空英,,0,0,0,,Woah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.91,0:06:50.91,青空中,,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:53.22,青空英,,0,0,0,,Secret meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:53.22,青空中,,0,0,0,,密会。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.22,0:06:55.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,I love the initiative.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.22,0:06:55.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,我喜欢这种主动性。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:56.55,青空英,,0,0,0,,What's the mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:56.55,青空中,,0,0,0,,任务是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.64,0:07:02.25,青空英,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.64,0:07:02.25,青空中,,0,0,0,,行吧，兄弟。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:04.04,青空英,,0,0,0,,Oh, you've got a BTEC in Sport, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:04.04,青空中,,0,0,0,,哦，你还拿了个体育方向的 BTEC 文凭，是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:05.14,青空英,,0,0,0,,Oh, congratulations, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:05.14,青空中,,0,0,0,,哦，恭喜啊，兄弟。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.14,0:07:06.24,青空英,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good luck in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.14,0:07:06.24,青空中,,0,0,0,,哦对了，祝你一直顺。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.40,0:07:08.32,青空英,,0,0,0,,Bro, stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.40,0:07:08.32,青空中,,0,0,0,,兄弟，别说了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.34,0:07:09.36,青空英,,0,0,0,,You're embarrassing yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.34,0:07:09.36,青空中,,0,0,0,,你在丢人现眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:12.32,青空英,,0,0,0,,How could you let this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:12.32,青空中,,0,0,0,,你怎么能让这种事发生？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.74,0:07:15.22,青空英,,0,0,0,,Human error is not in my job description.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.74,0:07:15.22,青空中,,0,0,0,,人为失误不在我的岗位职责里。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:17.67,青空英,,0,0,0,,Two short?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:17.67,青空中,,0,0,0,,小道两个？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.20,0:07:23.04,青空英,,0,0,0,,But, I mean, normally, it's usually just friends and family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.20,0:07:23.04,青空中,,0,0,0,,但我是说，通常也就亲朋好友看看。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:24.88,青空英,,0,0,0,,Two to three viewers, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:24.88,青空中,,0,0,0,,两三个观众，你懂吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.32,0:07:26.42,青空英,,0,0,0,,Actually, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.32,0:07:26.42,青空中,,0,0,0,,其实，不是。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:30.20,青空英,,0,0,0,,Alex, by the end, you were pulling about 5,000 to 10,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:30.20,青空中,,0,0,0,,Alex，到最后你都有 5000 到 1 万人在看了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.94,0:07:32.52,青空英,,0,0,0,,5,000 to 10,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.94,0:07:32.52,青空中,,0,0,0,,5000 到 1 万。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.52,0:07:34.08,青空英,,0,0,0,,I told you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.52,0:07:34.08,青空中,,0,0,0,,我跟你说过了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:35.54,青空英,,0,0,0,,This is not good, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:35.54,青空中,,0,0,0,,这可不妙，Alex。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.54,0:07:37.98,青空英,,0,0,0,,This is not good, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.54,0:07:37.98,青空中,,0,0,0,,这可不妙，兄弟。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.98,0:07:39.50,青空英,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.98,0:07:39.50,青空中,,0,0,0,,你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:41.20,青空英,,0,0,0,,We just went viral.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:41.20,青空中,,0,0,0,,我们刚火了一把。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.20,0:07:42.98,青空英,,0,0,0,,All the internet's talking about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.20,0:07:42.98,青空中,,0,0,0,,全网都在讨论我们。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.98,0:07:44.68,青空英,,0,0,0,,The Twitchers, the Kickers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.98,0:07:44.68,青空中,,0,0,0,,Twitch 的、Kick 的，那些平台。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.16,0:07:46.24,青空英,,0,0,0,,All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.16,0:07:46.24,青空中,,0,0,0,,所有人。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.16,0:07:48.70,青空英,,0,0,0,,5,000 to 10,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.16,0:07:48.70,青空中,,0,0,0,,5000 到 1 万。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.02,0:07:51.46,青空英,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.02,0:07:51.46,青空中,,0,0,0,,好。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.50,0:07:55.37,青空英,,0,0,0,,I said I'm going A.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.50,0:07:55.37,青空中,,0,0,0,,我说了我要去 A 点。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.82,0:08:09.30,青空英,,0,0,0,,He's swooping in under the rug.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.82,0:08:09.30,青空中,,0,0,0,,他是想把这事悄悄压下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.55,0:08:14.01,青空英,,0,0,0,,I think it never even happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.55,0:08:14.01,青空中,,0,0,0,,我觉得这事压根没发生过。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.71,0:08:18.36,青空英,,0,0,0,,We're so gonna get hacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.71,0:08:18.36,青空中,,0,0,0,,我们绝对要被黑了。
